</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Operation</th><th>Valid?</th><th>Reason</th></tr>
<tr><td>l.add(&quot;a&quot;)</td><td>Yes</td><td>L is ArrayList&lt;String&gt;</td></tr>
<tr><td>l.add(null)</td><td>Yes</td><td>Null is valid for every reference type</td></tr>
