<tr><th>Form</th><th>How to call</th><th>Add inside method</th><th>Best for</th></tr>
<tr><td>ArrayList&lt;String&gt;</td><td>Only ArrayList&lt;String&gt;</td><td>String + null</td><td>Read + write (String only)</td></tr>
<tr><td>ArrayList&lt;?&gt;</td><td>Any ArrayList</td><td>null only</td><td>Read-only</td></tr>
<tr><td>ArrayList&lt;? extends X&gt;</td><td>X or child/impl</td><td>null only</td><td>Read-only</td></tr>
